<https://w3id.org/eudpp/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The CORE is the integration ontology that imports all the specific ontology modules and the connector (bridge) ontology of these.\n\n--\nTHIS DOCUMENT IS PROVIDED WITH NO WARRANTIES WHATSOEVER. \nAll liability for any damages arising from use or misuse of this vocabulary is with the user."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-10-16"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
