<https://w3id.org/eudpp/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "CORE  of the EU DPP core ontology proposed by the CIRPASS-2 project."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "eudpp" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The CORE of the EU DPP core ontology proposal of the CIRPASS-2 European project."@en .
