# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Introduced to avoid using dcterms:provenance for epistemic source-status annotations."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://www.dublincore.org/specifications/dublin-core/dcmi-terms/terms/provenance/> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Annotation property used to state the epistemic or normative status of the source for an ontology resource, for example direct legal definition, explicit legal information element, ESPR-grounded modelling abstraction, or JRC draft proposal. It is intentionally distinct from dcterms:provenance, which is reserved for ownership and custody history."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "source status"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Provenance annotation identifying the vocabulary, standard, or ontology from which a class, property, or named individual of this ontology aligns with. \nPossible values: \"LCA ontology\" (introduced by this ontology, no direct external counterpart), \"ILCD base\" (corresponds to the ILCD base data format), \"ILCD+EPD extension\" (corresponds to the ILCD+EPD v1.3 extension, InData epd/epd2/epd24 namespaces), \"Dublin Core\" (aligned with dcterms), \"PROV-O\" (aligned with W3C Provenance Ontology), \"SKOS\" (aligned with W3C Simple Knowledge Organization System), \"FOAF\" (aligned with Friend of a Friend vocabulary), \"LCAnet\" (aligned with the LCAnet ontology)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "source vocabulary"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "LCA ontology"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#unitAsString
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#unitAsString> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#unitAsString> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Human-readable label of the unit in which the associated EN 15804 indicator value is expressed, e.g. \"kg CO2-eq\", \"MJ, net calorific value\", \"m3\". Annotation property (not for automated unit arithmetic)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#unitAsString> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "unit as string"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#unitAsString> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "LCA ontology"@en .
