<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasActor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasActor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links actor role assignment to actor"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasActor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has actor"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasActorRoleAssignment
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasActorRoleAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasActorRoleAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#isActorRoleAssignmentForEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasActorRoleAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ESPREvent> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasActorRoleAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ActorRoleAssignment> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasActorRoleAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an event to an actor-role assignment that is valid in the context of that event. This is a cross-module relation between EVENT and ACTOR and is therefore managed in the Connector/mapping layer.\n\nESPREvent is modelled in the EU DPP CO EVENT module.\nActorRoleAssignment is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasActorRoleAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has actor role assignment"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasApplicableQualification
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasApplicableQualification> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasApplicableQualification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstancePresence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasApplicableQualification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasApplicableQualification> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Articles 2(27) and 7(5)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasApplicableQualification> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasApplicableQualification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a SubstancePresence to an applicable qualification assertion; criterion (d) context is presence-scoped."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasApplicableQualification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasApplicableQualification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has applicable qualification"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasApplicableQualification> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> "ESPR-grounded contextual relation connecting a SubstancePresence to the qualification assertion applicable in that product-specific presence context."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasAuthorisedRepresentative
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasAuthorisedRepresentative> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasAuthorisedRepresentative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#EUDeclarationOfConformity> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasAuthorisedRepresentative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasAuthorisedRepresentative> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Decision No 768/2008/EC Annex I Art R1 (4)" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasAuthorisedRepresentative> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Annex V (2,9)" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasAuthorisedRepresentative> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dec/2008/768(1)/oj#anx_I" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasAuthorisedRepresentative> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj/#anx_%C2%A0V" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasAuthorisedRepresentative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies the natural or legal person established within the Union who has received a written mandate from a manufacturer to act on his behalf in relation to the Declaration of Conformity.\n\nEUDeclarationOfConformity is modelled in the EU DPP CO COMP module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module.\n\nSource: \nDecision No 768/2008/EC Annex I Art R1 (4)\nhttps://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dec/2008/768(1)/oj#anx_I\n\nESPR Annex V (2,9)\nhttps://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj/#anx_%C2%A0V"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasAuthorisedRepresentative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has authorised representative"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasBackUpCopyHost
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasBackUpCopyHost> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasBackUpCopyHost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#DPP> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasBackUpCopyHost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasBackUpCopyHost> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Annex III" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasBackUpCopyHost> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasBackUpCopyHost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The reference of the digital product passport service provider hosting the back-up copy of the digital product passport [ESPR Annex III].\n\nDPP is modelled in the EU DPP CO P_DPP module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasBackUpCopyHost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has back-up-copy host"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasComplianceDeclaration
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasComplianceDeclaration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasComplianceDeclaration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#LCAStudy> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasComplianceDeclaration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ComplianceDeclaration> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasComplianceDeclaration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Link from an LCAStudy (or its subclass EPDStudy) to a ComplianceDeclaration. Compliance can be declared against any standard relevant to the study type (ISO 14040/14044, ISO 14025, ISO 14067, ISO 21930, EN 15804+A2, PEFCR-specific rules, etc.)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasComplianceDeclaration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has compliance declaration"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasComplianceDeclaration> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "ILCD base: Corresponds to the element complianceDeclarations/compliance. Domain widened in v1.9.7 from EPDStudy to LCAStudy."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstancePresence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ConcentrationOfSubstanceOfConcern> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a substance presence to concentration information. A concentration is contextual to the structural location identified by the associated SubstancePresence. \n\nDifferent product, component, or spare-part locations requiring different concentrations should normally use distinct SubstancePresence records. \n\nExact, maximum, and range representations remain distinguished by the existing P_DPP/SOC concentration model.\n\nConcentrationOfSubstanceOfConcern is modelled in the EU DPP CO P_DPP module.\nSubstancePresence is modelled in the EU DPP CO IDENT module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has concentration"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDPP
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDPP> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDPP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Product> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDPP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#DPP> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDPP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Product has a DPP. The property links a Product with a DPP."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDPP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has DPP"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDPPActionType
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDPPActionType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDPPActionType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#DPPUpdateEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDPPActionType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#DPPActionType> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDPPActionType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a DPP update event to the type of information-level action performed on the Digital Product Passport."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDPPActionType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has DPP action type"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDigitalProductPassportId
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDigitalProductPassportId> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDigitalProductPassportId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#DPP> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDigitalProductPassportId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#DPPIdentifier> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDigitalProductPassportId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Realisation for the Unique identifier of an instance of the digital product passport.\n\nDPP is modelled in the EU DPP CO P_DPP module.\nDPPIdentifier is modelled in the EU DPP CO IDENT module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDigitalProductPassportId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has digital product passport id"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDisassemblyInstruction
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDisassemblyInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDisassemblyInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstancePresence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDisassemblyInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstanceManagementInstruction> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDisassemblyInstruction> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Article 7(5)(e)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDisassemblyInstruction> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDisassemblyInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a substance presence to information relevant for disassembly."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDisassemblyInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDisassemblyInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Has disassembly instruction"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasDisassemblyInstruction> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> "representation of an information element explicitly required by the cited ESPR provision; the RDF resource itself is an ontology modelling construct."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEUDeclarationOfConformity
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEUDeclarationOfConformity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEUDeclarationOfConformity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Product> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEUDeclarationOfConformity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#EUDeclarationOfConformity> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEUDeclarationOfConformity> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Decision No 768/2008/EC Annex I Art R10" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEUDeclarationOfConformity> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Art 44" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEUDeclarationOfConformity> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dec/2008/768(1)/oj#anx_I" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEUDeclarationOfConformity> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj/#art_44" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEUDeclarationOfConformity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies the EU declaration of conformity issued for the product.\n\nEUDeclarationOfConformity is modelled in the EU DPP CO COMP module.\nProduct is modelled in the EU DPP CO P_DPP module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEUDeclarationOfConformity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has EU Declaration of Conformity"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEconomicOperator
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEconomicOperator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEconomicOperator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Product> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEconomicOperator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEconomicOperator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Linking the product to the economic operator (Actor from ACTOR module).\n\nProduct is modelled in the EU DPP CO P_DPP module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEconomicOperator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has economic operator"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEndOfLifeManagementInstruction
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEndOfLifeManagementInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEndOfLifeManagementInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstancePresence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEndOfLifeManagementInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstanceManagementInstruction> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEndOfLifeManagementInstruction> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Article 7(5)(e)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEndOfLifeManagementInstruction> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEndOfLifeManagementInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a substance presence to information relevant for environmentally sound management of the product at end-of-life."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEndOfLifeManagementInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEndOfLifeManagementInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Has end-of-life management instruction"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasEndOfLifeManagementInstruction> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> "representation of an information element explicitly required by the cited ESPR provision; the RDF resource itself is an ontology modelling construct."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasExternalSource
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasExternalSource> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasExternalSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#LCAStudy> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasExternalSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Source> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasExternalSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Link from an LCAStudy to a background source. It can be a (a) documentation (e.g. an LCA project report, safety data sheet, or explanatory material) - covering the ILCD+EPD element referenceToExternalDocumentation on dataSetInformation, (b) databases or, (c)  literature sources used for modelling."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasExternalSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has external source"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasExternalSource> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "LCA ontology"@en .
# 
