# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasInventoryIndicatorResult
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasInventoryIndicatorResult> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasInventoryIndicatorResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasLCAResult> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasInventoryIndicatorResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#LCAStudy> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasInventoryIndicatorResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#InventoryIndicatorResult> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasInventoryIndicatorResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sub-property of eudpp:hasLCAResult; range narrowed to eudpp:InventoryIndicatorResult."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasInventoryIndicatorResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has inventory indicator result"@en .
