<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasLicenseType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has license type"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasLicenseType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "ILCD base: Corresponds to the element publicationAndOwnership/licenseType."@en .
# 
