<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasManufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has manufacturer"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasManufacturingSite
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasManufacturingSite> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasManufacturingSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ManufacturerRecord> .
