<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterial> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialOfComposition> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterial> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Linking the Product to a MaterialOfComposition.\n\nProduct is modelled in the EU DPP CO P_DPP module.\nMaterialOfComposition is modelled in the EU DPP CO MAT module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterial> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has material"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialIdentifier
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialOfComposition> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialIdentifier> .
