<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialOrigin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialOfComposition> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialOrigin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialOrigin> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialOrigin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Assigns material origin to material used for product"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialOrigin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has material origin"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialType
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialOfComposition> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialType> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links material to its type in some classification system used by the sector."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMaterialType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has material type"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMeasurementUnit
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMeasurementUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
