<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasSafeUseInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a substance presence to relevant instructions for the safe use of the product."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasSafeUseInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasSafeUseInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Has safe-use instruction"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasSafeUseInstruction> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> "representation of an information element explicitly required by the cited ESPR provision; the RDF resource itself is an ontology modelling construct."@en .
