<https://w3id.org/eudpp#inContextOfDPP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates the actor role assignment to a specific Digital Product Passport instance (from P_DPP module).\n\nActorRoleAssignment is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module.\nDPP is modelled in the EU DPP CO P_DPP module.\n        "@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#inContextOfDPP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "in context of DPP"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#inContextOfProduct
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#inContextOfProduct> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
