<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isComponentOf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isComponentOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A product is a component of another product.\n\n‘component’ means a product intended to be incorporated into another product; [ESPR Art 2(2)]"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isComponentOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is component of"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#isConformWith
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isConformWith> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
