<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isEstablishedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/Location> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isEstablishedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a legal person to the location where it is established."@en .
