<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isRepresentedByCarrier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a product event concept to an EPCIS-inspired technical event carrier used to journalise and structure the corresponding event data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isRepresentedByCarrier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is represented by carrier"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#isResidingIn
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isResidingIn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
