<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isRoleOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Role> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isRoleOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ActorRoleAssignment> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isRoleOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates role to an actor role assignment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isRoleOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is role of"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSignedBy
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSignedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
