<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSignedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSignedBy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Annex V (9, 10)" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSignedBy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj/#anx_%C2%A0V" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSignedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies the natural or legal person signying the Declaration of Conformity.\n\n\nEUDeclarationOfConformity is modelled in the EU DPP CO COMP module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSignedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is signed by"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSparePartOf
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSparePartOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSparePartOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Product> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSparePartOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Product> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSparePartOf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Annex I"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSparePartOf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSparePartOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A product is a spare part of another product."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSparePartOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is spare part of"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSubstancePresenceOf
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSubstancePresenceOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
