<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isUsedByActor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isUsedByActor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a facility to an actor."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isUsedByActor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is used by actor"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#issuesCertificate
