<https://w3id.org/eudpp#issuesCertificate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Annex V (7)" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#issuesCertificate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj/#anx_%C2%A0V" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#issuesCertificate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies conformity assessment certificate issued for a certification.\n\n\nConformityCertificate is modelled in the EU DPP CO COMP module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#issuesCertificate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "issues certificate"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAssessmentAccordingTo
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAssessmentAccordingTo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAssessmentAccordingTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAssessmentAccordingTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ConformityAssessmentModule> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAssessmentAccordingTo> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Annex V (7)" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAssessmentAccordingTo> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj/#anx_%C2%A0V" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAssessmentAccordingTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies conformity assess procedure/cerfication scheme performed by the notified body.\n\n\nConformityAssessmentModule is modelled in the EU DPP CO COMP module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAssessmentAccordingTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "performed assessment according to"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ProductEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Facility> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a product event to the facility where the event was performed or operationally occurred. This is a cross-module relation between EVENT and ACTOR/Facility and is therefore managed in the Connector/mapping layer.\n\nProductEvent is modelled in the EU DPP CO EVENT module.\nFacility is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "performed at"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://ref.gs1.org/epcis/bizLocation> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://ref.gs1.org/epcis/readPoint> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ProductEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a product event to the actor that performed, carried out, or was operationally responsible for the event. This is a cross-module relation between EVENT and ACTOR and is therefore managed in the Connector/mapping layer.\n\nProductEvent is modelled in the EU DPP CO EVENT module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "performed by"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ActorRoleAssignment> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#qualifiesSubstance
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#qualifiesSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#qualifiesSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasQualificationAssertion> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#qualifiesSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#qualifiesSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstanceOfConcern> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#qualifiesSubstance> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Article 2(27)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#qualifiesSubstance> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#qualifiesSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a qualification assertion to the substance of concern that it positively qualifies."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#qualifiesSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#qualifiesSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "qualifies substance"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#qualifiesSubstance> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> "ESPR-grounded modelling relation connecting an explicit qualification assertion to the SubstanceOfConcern it qualifies."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#quantifiesIndicator
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#quantifiesIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#quantifiesIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#LCAResult> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#quantifiesIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#LCAIndicator> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#quantifiesIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Link from an LCAResult (LCIAResult or InventoryIndicatorResult) to the LCAIndicator individual that this result quantifies. \nThis is the primary semantic identity of a result: a result is a quantification of an indicator, not of a method. \nCardinality: exactly 1 per result instance.\nRange: LCAIndicator (covers both EN15804Indicator individuals and non-EN-15804 indicators)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#quantifiesIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "quantifies indicator"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#quantifiesIndicator> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "LCA ontology"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordedBy
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#DPPEventRecord> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a DPP event record to the actor that created the technical record of the logged DPP-side event. This is a cross-module relation between EVENT and ACTOR and is therefore managed in the Connector/mapping layer.\n\nDPPEventRecord is modelled in the EU DPP CO EVENT module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "recorded by"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordsDPPEvent
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordsDPPEvent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordsDPPEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#isRecordedAs> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordsDPPEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#DPPEventRecord> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordsDPPEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#DPPEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordsDPPEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a DPP event record to the DPP event whose technical registration it captures."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordsDPPEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "records DPP event"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToCompleteReviewReport
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToCompleteReviewReport> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToCompleteReviewReport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Review> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToCompleteReviewReport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ReviewReport> .
