# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceStatus
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ComplianceDeclaration> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ComplianceStatus> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Level of compliance declared by a ComplianceDeclaration (fully compliant, partially compliant, or not compliant)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "reference to compliance status"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceStatus> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "LCA ontology"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceSystem
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceSystem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ComplianceDeclaration> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ComplianceSystem> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Link from a ComplianceDeclaration to the standard or programme it references (EN 15804+A2, ISO 14025, ISO 21930, etc.)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "reference to compliance system"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToComplianceSystem> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "ILCD base: Corresponds to the element compliance/referenceToComplianceSystem."@en .
