# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToOriginalEPD
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToOriginalEPD> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToOriginalEPD> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#EPDStudy> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToOriginalEPD> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#EPDDocument> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToOriginalEPD> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Link from the machine-readable EPDStudy to the published EPD document (typically PDF)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToOriginalEPD> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "reference to original EPD"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#referenceToOriginalEPD> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "ILCD+EPD extension: Corresponds to the element epd2:referenceToOriginalEPD."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#relatesToLCAIndicator
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#relatesToLCAIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#relatesToLCAIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#EN15804ImpactIndicator> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#relatesToLCAIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#LCIAImpactIndicator> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#relatesToLCAIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates an EN15804 impact indicator to the conceptually corresponding EF 3.1 / PEF LCIA impact indicator. \nThe two indicators are not equivalent — EN15804 indicators are EPD-specific reporting slots defined by EN15804+A2, while LCIA impact indicators follow the broader EF 3.1 characterisation framework. This property records a conceptual correspondence without implying any equivalence."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#relatesToLCAIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "relates to LCA indicator"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#relatesToLCAIndicator> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "LCA ontology"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#representsManufacturer
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#representsManufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#representsManufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#AuthorisedRepresentativeRoleAssignment> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#representsManufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#representsManufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Used when the role is authorisedRepresentativeRole to indicate the manufacturer being represented."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#representsManufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "represents manufacturer"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#representsManufacturerForProduct
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#representsManufacturerForProduct> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#representsManufacturerForProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#AuthorisedRepresentativeRoleAssignment> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#representsManufacturerForProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Product> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#representsManufacturerForProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates which product(s) the authorised representative's mandate covers.\n\nAuthorisedRepresentativeRoleAssignment is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module.\nProduct is modelled in the EU DPP CO P_DPP module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#representsManufacturerForProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "represents manufacturer for product"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#triggersDPPEvent
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#triggersDPPEvent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#triggersDPPEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#isTriggeredByProductEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#triggersDPPEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ProductEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#triggersDPPEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#DPPEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#triggersDPPEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a product event to a DPP event that is triggered as a consequence of it, reflecting the obligation to update the DPP following lifecycle changes of the product."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#triggersDPPEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "triggers DPP event"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#usedForPresumptionOfConformity
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#usedForPresumptionOfConformity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#usedForPresumptionOfConformity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ProductRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#usedForPresumptionOfConformity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#UnionHarmonisationLegislation> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#usedForPresumptionOfConformity> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dec/2008/768(1)/oj#anx_I\t\nDecision No 768/2008/EC Annex I Art R8"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#usedForPresumptionOfConformity> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj/#art_41\nESPR Art 41"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#usedForPresumptionOfConformity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This property specifies which harmonised standards (or parts thereof) was used to assess conformity with the Union harmonistation legislation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#usedForPresumptionOfConformity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "used for presumtion of conformity"@en .
