<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CarbonFootprint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An LCIAResult that \"means the sum of greenhouse gas emissions and greenhouse gas removals in a product system, expressed as CO equivalents and based on a life cycle assessment using the single impact category of climate change\". (ESPR Art 2 25))\n \nIt quantifies the global warming potential of a product over a 100-year time horizon.\nInstances of this class quantify either the EN 15804+A2 individual \"GWP-total - Global Warming Potential (total)\" (ind_GWPtotal, an EN15804ImpactIndicator) or the EF 3.1 \"Climate Change EF\" indicator (ind_EF_climateChange, an LCIAImpactIndicator), depending on the reporting framework of the EPD or LCA study."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CarbonFootprint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Carbon Footprint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CarbonFootprint> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "ESPR Art 2 (25) https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CarbonFootprint> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "LCAnet: relates to the element CarbonFootprint (https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#CarbonFootprint) of the IA module."@en .
