<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CircularEconomyIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Circular Economy indicators are measures for relevant monitoring the transition to a circular economy and to measure the effects of new policy and trends.\n\nThis class description needs to be extended/specialised according to the corresponding delegated acts or/and industry standards."@en .
