<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ConformityAssessmentRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Conformity assessment means the process demonstrating whether the ecodesign requirements set out in the relevant delegated acts adopted pursuant to Article 4 have been fulfilled; [ESPR Art 2 (51)]"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ConformityAssessmentRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Conformity assessment role"@en .
