# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#DigitalInstruction
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#DigitalInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#DigitalInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#DocumentFormattedProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#DigitalInstruction> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Art 27(7)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#DigitalInstruction> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#DigitalInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Digital instructions\nmean instructions in digital format concerning the product (‘digital instructions’) in a language that can be easily understood. ESPR Art 27(7)\nDigital instructions are ensured by manufacturers. These should also ensured by importers. (ESPR Art 29(4))\n\nThis class can be extended/specialised according to delegated acts or industry standards."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#DigitalInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#DigitalInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DigitalInstruction"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#DocumentFormattedProperty
