<https://w3id.org/eudpp#EN15804ImpactIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An EN 15804+A2 characterised impact indicator (core set of 13 or the 6 additional \"with caveats\" indicators). Characterised via the EF 3.1 characterisation models. Results computed for this indicator are eudpp:LCIAResult instances."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#EN15804ImpactIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EN 15804 Impact Indicator"@en .
