# https://w3id.org/eudpp#ESPREvent
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ESPREvent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ESPREvent> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ESPREvent> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Regulation (EU) 2024/1781; lifecycle-event-oriented abstraction introduced for modelling purposes."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ESPREvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Abstract superclass introduced for modelling purposes. Used to represent the regulatory or business semantics of an event relevant in the ESPR context and concerning either a product or its DPP, independently of its technical journalisation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ESPREvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> "https://w3id.org/eudpp/EVENT" .
