<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Identifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Identifier. A general class to hold different kinds of identifiers described and used for EU DPP CO. Each sub-class of this class describes a different kind of identifier. Intentionally modelled as sub-classes. \nIdentifiers have value, and a scheme/standard they are based on.\n\nCardinatlity restrictions added to each subclass to enforce inheritance of the data propertyy identifierValue."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Identifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Identifier" .
