<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ImpactModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The characterisation model underlying an LCIA method (e.g. IPCC AR6 2021 for GWP). It carries a model name (eudpp:modelName), optional version (eudpp:modelVersion), and optional bibliographic source (eudpp:referenceToModelSource)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ImpactModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Impact Model"@en .
