_:genid103 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#maxQualifiedCardinality> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
_:genid103 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#forScenario> .
