<https://w3id.org/eudpp#LCIAResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A characterised LCA result quantifying one LCIA indicator (an EN15804ImpactIndicator or an LCIAImpactIndicator ) for a product system. Each instance is linked to exactly one indicator individual via quantifiesIndicator, and carries its numerical value per life-cycle module via hasLCAModuleValue."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#LCIAResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LCIA Result"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#LCIAResult> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "ILCD+EPD extension: corresponds to the element LCIAResults/LCIAResult when the indicator is a characterised impact indicator."@en .
