# https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Article 2(27)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2006/1907/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2008/1272/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2019/1021/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A documented, explicit assertion that a substance satisfies one or more non-exclusive qualification criteria in ESPR Article 2(27). For criterion (d), the applicable product context is represented by a dpp:SubstancePresence linked through dpp:hasApplicableQualification. This modelling construct records asserted qualification evidence; it does not infer legal status."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SoC qualification assertion"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCQualificationAssertion> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> "ESPR-grounded modelling construct for recording an explicit Article 2(27) qualification; the assertion is not itself a legal term and the ontology does not infer legal status."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#Source
