<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A bibliographic or documentary source referenced from an LCA study, EPD study or LCIA Method. Abstract superclass; concrete source instances typically use one of the more specific subclasses (PCR, LCAMethodReport, BackgroundDatabase, ComplianceSystem, ReviewReport, EPDDocument)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Source"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Source> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "ILCD+EPD extension: Corresponds to the element Source Data Set."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#Substance
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Substance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
