<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Substance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A chemical substance used as the generic superclass for substance identity and naming information. In this SOC module it primarily supports the modelling of dpp:SubstanceOfConcern; its presence does not make SOC a general-purpose substance-reporting module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Substance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Substance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> "https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Substance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Substance"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Substance> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> "direct legal definition reproduced from the cited legislation."@en .
