<https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstanceManagementInstruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An instruction concerning the management of a substance of concern in its SubstancePresence context, including safe use, disassembly, preparation for reuse, reuse, recycling and environmentally sound end-of-life management. This domain-specific modelling abstraction supports the information elements in ESPR Article 7(5)(d)-(e); it is not a term defined by the Regulation and does not determine legal obligations or applicability."@en .
