<https://w3id.org/eudpp#UnionHarmonisationLegislation> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Decision No 768/2008/EC Annex I Art R1 (17)\nhttps://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dec/2008/768(1)/oj#anx_I"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#UnionHarmonisationLegislation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Union Harmonisation Legislation shall mean any Union legislation harmonising the conditions for the marketing of products. Examples are directives, regulations and delegated acts."@en .
