<https://w3id.org/eudpp#WaterConsumptionResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An LCA inventory indicator result quantifying the net consumption of fresh water resources in a product system. \nThis class is typically associated with the EN 15804+A2 inventory indicator “Use of net fresh water” (FW), though no formal quantifiesIndicator restriction is imposed to allow for future indicator additions or revised indicator frameworks."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#WaterConsumptionResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Water Consumption Result"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#WaterConsumptionResult> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "LCA ontology"@en .
