# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#CriterionA
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CriterionA> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CriterionA> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CriterionA> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Article 2(27)(a); REACH Articles 57 and 59(1)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CriterionA> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2006/1907/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CriterionA> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CriterionA> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The substance meets the relevant REACH Article 57 criteria and has been identified under Article 59(1)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CriterionA> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CriterionA> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The substance meets the relevant REACH Article 57 criteria and has been identified under Article 59(1)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#CriterionA> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SoCCriterionScheme> .
