<https://w3id.org/eudpp#EORI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Economic Operators Registration and Identification (EU).\nThis is the EU’s official identifier for companies involved in import/export.\nMandatory for any company trading with the EU.\n\nUsed in customs declarations\nUnique per company\n\nFormat: country code + number (e.g., DE123456789)\n\nThis is the most widely used identifier for economic operators in EU trade."@en .
