<https://w3id.org/eudpp#GLN> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A globally unique identifier defined by GS1 used to identify legal entities, functional entities, and physical locations within business and supply chain processes.\n\nTypically identifies: legal entities, functional entities (departments), physical locations (warehouses, sites)."@en .
