<https://w3id.org/eudpp#GTIN> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#identifierExampleValue> "14006381333938" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#GTIN> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#identifierMaxLength> "14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#GTIN> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#identifierMinLength> "8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
