<https://w3id.org/eudpp#LEI> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#identifierExampleValue> "529900T8BM49AURSDO55" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#LEI> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#identifierMaxLength> "20"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
