<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ind_EPfreshwater> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "ILCD+EPD extension" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ind_EPfreshwater> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#unitAsString> "kg P-eq"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ind_EPfreshwater> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/LCA#relatesToLCAIndicator> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ind_EF_eutrophicationFreshwater> .
