<https://w3id.org/eudpp#remanufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An actor performing remanufacturing, which means \"actions through which a new product is produced from objects that are waste, products or components and through which at least one change is made that substantially affects the safety, performance, purpose or type of the product\"; [ESPR Art 2 (16)]"@en .
